DESCRIPTION >
    Alerts: day-over-day conversion comparison. Tenant-scoped; prunes via
    (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/alerts.js:54
    (queryName 'alert_conversions'). Typed-column translation: properties.site_id
    -> site_id, event -> event_type. No JSON-bag fields.
    IDENTICAL query text to integ_conversions.pipe (api/routes/integrations.js:144)
    — duplicate logic across two route files, flagged as a Phase-6
    consolidation candidate (noted, not acted on).
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

NODE alert_conversions_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT
        SUM(CASE WHEN timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 1 DAY THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS today,
        SUM(CASE WHEN timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 2 DAY AND timestamp < now() - INTERVAL 1 DAY THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS yesterday
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$conversion'
      AND lower(coalesce(conversion_type, '')) != 'refund'
      AND timestamp >= now() - INTERVAL 2 DAY

TYPE endpoint
